X: 1
T: The Meek Shall Inherit
O: Alan Menken, 1982
N: Seymour's temptation number from Little Shop of Horrors. Melody is the top
N: voice of the piano channel in a hamienet.com MIDI (id 7951), key C major and
N: octave as in the source; the shouted high notes of the builds are folded down
N: an octave for the recorder, and the vamp's clipped notes are sustained to the
N: next onset. Chords fitted from the accompaniment (Am7-Dm7 doo-wop, the F7-G7
N: middle and the E7 lift). The pushing entries are straightened; pitches are
N: the source's. Form: the theme, the middle section and the theme again (source
N: bars 23-46); the G# of the middle is written _A.
